<title>USA: Sodak Gaming Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Sodak Gaming Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RAPID CITY, S.D. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Condensed Consolidated Earnings Statements</p>
<p>				     (Unaudited)</p>
<p>	     Amounts in Millions except earnings per share</p>
<p>		Three Months Ended   %	    9 Months Ended  %</p>
<p>		 9/30/96  9/30/95  Chg.	9/30/96  9/30/95 Chg.</p>
<p>   Total revenues	63.1   24.5  157.7  119.4  62.2   92.2</p>
<p>   Net earnings	   5.2    3.7   40.4   12.0   8.2   47.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share    0.23   0.16	    0.52  0.36</p>
<p>NOTE:  Earnings per share figures reflect the two-for-one stock split effective Sept. 27, 1996, for all reporting periods.</p>
